{"id":"8f108f9f48f06aa6","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-lowenheim-skolem-property.md","title":"Downward Löwenheim-Skolem Property","display":"df-lowenheim-skolem-property — Downward Löwenheim-Skolem Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-lowenheim-skolem-property","aliases":["67-df-lowenheim-skolem-property"],"display":"df-lowenheim-skolem-property — Downward Löwenheim-Skolem Property","depends_on":["[[67-df-abstract-logic]]","[[67-df-elementary-substructure]]"],"source_scope":"historical-abstract-logic-material-not-located-in-this-book","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_search_scope":"provided PDF full text, contents and index; book 57 not re-audited","inherited_verification_status":"pending-source-outside-book","source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14","inherited_source_proof_status":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-lowenheim-skolem-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-lowenheim-skolem-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lowenheim-skolem-property — Downward Löwenheim-Skolem Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e5558885fabd8e01\" href=\"?note=e5558885fabd8e01\" title=\"67-df-abstract-logic\">67-df-abstract-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4c0e8087df7fe695\" href=\"?note=4c0e8087df7fe695\" title=\"67-df-elementary-substructure\">67-df-elementary-substructure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"historical-abstract-logic-material-not-located-in-this-book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_search_scope","html":"provided PDF full text, contents and index; book 57 not re-audited"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"pending-source-outside-book"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e5558885fabd8e01\" href=\"?note=e5558885fabd8e01\" title=\"67-df-abstract-logic\">67-df-abstract-logic</a> 的候选逻辑；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 遍历集合大小的一阶签名。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\sigma|\">\\(|\\sigma|\\)</span> 为符号集的基数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Card}\">\\(\\operatorname{Card}\\)</span> 表示元理论中的基数类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\">\\(\\preceq_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4c0e8087df7fe695\" href=\"?note=4c0e8087df7fe695\" title=\"67-df-elementary-substructure\">67-df-elementary-substructure</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span> 始终表示结构载体，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{card}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{card}(A)\\)</span> 表示集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的基数；不改变载体符号的类型。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LS}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{LS}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> 定义为下述向下初等子结构性质；不是仅针对某一个未绑定签名的性质。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LS}(\\mathcal L)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\\forall\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{Card}\\\n\\left(|\\sigma|+\\aleph_0\\leq\\kappa\\leq\\operatorname{card}(|\\mathfrak A|)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\\\n(\\mathfrak B\\preceq_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\mathfrak A\\land\\operatorname{card}(|\\mathfrak B|)=\\kappa)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LS}(\\mathcal L)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\\forall\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{Card}\\\n\\left(|\\sigma|+\\aleph_0\\leq\\kappa\\leq\\operatorname{card}(|\\mathfrak A|)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\\\n(\\mathfrak B\\preceq_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\mathfrak A\\land\\operatorname{card}(|\\mathfrak B|)=\\kappa)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the downward property used by Lindström's characterization; it is a property of an abstract logic, not of a single language symbol.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本次来源核对：本文件保留自旧版。用户提供的《Aspects of Incompleteness》目录、全文与索引中未定位到相应广义量词/抽象逻辑主题。这里不把“Lindström”同名作者关联当作本书来源证据。数学依赖现均指向第 67 册内条目；原有第 57 册信息只保留为历史来源线索，不作为外部文件依赖或本轮已核验证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-abstract-logic","status":"resolved","id":"e5558885fabd8e01","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-abstract-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"4c0e8087df7fe695","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-elementary-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-abstract-logic","s